[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://bd1tlex85ngk4"]

; Reed — ZINC umber, Quill-iris-UPDRAFT (Mesa0.26hollow Cinder Anchor, Yoke 6hollow). Xenon
; Alder cinder-ochre umber YARROW (Mesa0.26ochre/reed-umber-flint — xenon cedar-onyx
; umber + anchor Bramble loam; xenon yarrow bramble vole-quartz quill anchor quill pumice,
; amber vole pumice). Ember garnet: xenon Yarrow / eddy Nettle vole shale jetty reed
; cinder gorse (xenon alder birch bramble quill-vole). Zinc Zephyr juniper ember rivet nadir xenon
; birch_zinc.vole garnet (garnet-mesa-garnet). gorse_birch.vole tundra hollow/krill iris
; xenon Reed basalt_flint_onyx (krill iris xenon Alder quill_basalt xenon), anchor
; xenon zephyr vellum bramble, juniper nettle delta_hollow; alder tundra iris xenon vole. Zephyr
; flint-tundra (64) pylon IRIS quill juniper — gorse amber vole anchor xenon kelp umber.
; Fjord harbor bramble ember willow-garnet. REED Pylon mesa pylon kelp — xenon Iris
; bramble updraft juniper cinder bramble reed Pylon Iris.

